id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.7-Universal
versionCode=5700
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=QF/K706 (or MG clone) only: UIS7862 full module, UIS8581 reduced profile (factory 16-bit/44.1 kHz kept). On UIS7862 bit-to-bit audio: 24-bit/48 kHz path at 0 dB, volume and effects on the sound processor only (BU32107 or BD37xxx). One playback output per PCM, raw unprocessed microphone for wDSP (no DP), navigation ducking, call microphone with headroom and echo cancellation on SIM (handsfree CVS), BT calls without forced communication mode, and working VoIP calls (Telegram) without the broken Unisoc VoIP record mode.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kostyamat/BitPerfec-Audio-Qf-module-Magisk/v5.4-repaired/update.json
